WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:09.240
What I collect is mainly Iron Man Hot Toys

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.280
and till date I have 105 figures.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.500
Hi I'm Terence Tee

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:19.140
I'm 37 years old this year and

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.120
currently in the real estate industry

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:35.280
I will display them in a certain order
I have arranged The Iron Legion,

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.960
which consists of Mk I to now Mk 47.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:45.500
I will also customise certain figures as per what I want that was seen in the movie

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:52.720
Actually, my figures they are not as
precious as some collectors because I

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:57.040
will dismantle them, I will display them,
I will play with it.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:01.720
I will try to display individual parts of the Iron Man figures,

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:05.840
like helmets, the arc reactors, gauntlets and figures.

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:08.080
so every piece looks very unique.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.220
Of course there are some collectors that might think I went overboard

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:17.560
by destroying a very expensive figure by dismantling it.

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:21.140
But for me I think that
is it's the passion of how much I want

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.280
my display to be

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:35.200
As a very impatient collector, I do
customise figures not available in the market.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:41.679
For customization, I will rely on
this Iron Man manual.

00:01:41.679 --> 00:01:46.149
I have to study what are the colours, 
what are individual parts consists of

00:01:46.149 --> 00:01:51.310
then I gotta go and source for the parts
and then proceed with the customization.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:56.160
A single mark can consist of up to four figures.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:58.640
For example, for this, it is the mk 13.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:01:59.480
The torso

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:06.600
consists of maybe mk 40 but the
shoulder pads comes from a mark 7

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:11.960
of course I have to learn how to
airspray it, I got to learn how to attach

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:17.620
things, I've got to putty, and sand it
off to achieve that custom that I'm

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:20.430
trying to build.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:24.760
It really does take time and effort. The
hardest part is actually the masking.

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:29.600
Mask it, spray it, unmask it, and then do
the same process for the rest of the

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.960
part. Attach them back together and make sure
everything looks good

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:36.520
according to what was in the manual.

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:40.480
Of course during this period I did break

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:45.269
certain pieces. Things that I broke which
I couldn't fix I will try to put them

00:02:45.269 --> 00:02:50.040
into this diorama which I did. This
diorama actually consists of all the

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:57.139
figures that I have, which I display them
as all those has already perished like

00:02:57.139 --> 00:03:00.959
Thanos' Gauntlet holding on to Spider-Man's mask

00:03:00.959 --> 00:03:07.439
I have figures of broken shield from Captain
America, Iron Man armor that was being

00:03:07.439 --> 00:03:11.700
destroyed. Most of the Avengers figures that I have all the spare parts I will

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:14.800
all put inside the diorama.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:18.209
The one that I find most unique about my display

00:03:18.209 --> 00:03:23.250
are the Holograms. because it is not
available on market. Thanks to some

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:28.620
customizers. They have to cast every individual part
and they have to attach them together.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:32.030
It even comes with a light up feature.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:37.260
The biggest figure that I have is 
the Hot Toys

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:43.730
Iron Man Mark 44, which is the Hulkbuster.
It is about 12 kg and it's very detailed,

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:53.590
although it is not very pose-able

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:57.920
This room is basically my man-cave and
also my office.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:04.820
In the daytime I need to have the discipline
the work in this room. Of course there are

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:08.360
times when I'm talking to my clients and I
get distracted by the figures.

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:12.590
Usually after ten when I stop work. I will
turn on all the lights and that's when

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:15.060
I start to admire the figures.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:18.170
Sometimes when a particular
figure catches my eye, I will take it off

00:04:18.170 --> 00:04:20.340
the shelf, try to play with it.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:25.160
Displaying in this way the most tedious part,

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:30.140
a collector faces is to clean up.
It cost about 10 K to do all the display so

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:33.650
no choice if you love this hobby and you
would like to display it, the only way

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:38.900
you have to do is also to clean it up, to
make the figure looks the most tip-top

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:44.120
condition as possible.
I only clean my figures maybe about

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:51.430
twice a year but because every day I've
been touching them so it will get less dusty.

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:03.720
I'm married with two kids and have three
dogs at home. This hobby actually

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:09.720
has been inculcated in our daily life.
During the day when my kids are home they

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:13.170
will come to this room, they will look at my
display. They will try to spot if there

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:17.370
is anything new that I did to the display.
My kids even know the

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:23.670
particular characters of some of the
figures that I own.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:30.000
My wife is very supportive, she actually bought me stuff
like a 1:1 War Machine bust.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:37.350
She got me Mk 6 bust as well, so they
have been very supportive.

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:42.690
I also have this dog, her name is Vinny. She is very
close with me and she's actually the keeper

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:47.760
of my man cave. Whenever I'm home she'll
be inside and basically she sleeps in

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:50.180
this room.

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:56.520
I would think that as long Hot Toys
produces Iron Man, I will be preparing to

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:59.150
purchase it.

